public/privacy.html:15:<p>The current bot keeps conversation history in server memory, subject to the conversation cache's expiry, and loses that history when the server restarts. The application does not currently maintain a persistent conversation database. Operational and error logs may contain diagnostic information and are handled separately from the conversation cache. Copies in your WhatsApp chat and information retained by service providers are separate from the bot's memory.</p>
public/privacy.html:17:<p>You can stop using the bot at any time or block it in WhatsApp. For access, correction, or deletion requests about information controlled by the operator, email the contact above. See the <a href="/data-deletion">data-deletion instructions</a>. The operator cannot directly delete copies controlled by WhatsApp, Meta, DeepSeek, Crustdata, or ngrok.</p>
